      "statement": "Kyverno 1.13 drops deprecated API versions from its CRDs (the rendered chart removes v2alpha1 from cleanuppolicies, clustercleanuppolicies and policyexceptions). Existing stored resources must be migrated: a Helm hook does this automatically, and installs without Helm or the Helm hook can use kube-storage-version-migrator."
